 "plan_markdown": "# Implementation plan: A simple calculator web app\n*Plan version 1 \u00b7 written by claude-opus-5-5 from the approved brief*\n\nA static habit tracker.\n\n## Technology\n\n- Vite (fast dev server)\n\n## Architecture\n\nOne page, local storage.\n\n**Data model:** localStorage: habits[]\n\n**Project structure**\n\n- src/main.js: entry\n\n**Dependencies**\n\n- vitest: tests\n\n**Frontend components**\n\n- HabitList: shows habits\n\n## Phases and tasks\n\n### P1. Setup\n*Project runs.*\n\n**T1. Scaffold the project**\n\nVite + vitest.\n\n- Files: `package.json`, `src/main.js`\n- Done when: npm test passes\n- Verified by: `ls package.json src/main.js`\n\n### P2. Features\n*MVP works.*\n\n**T2. Habit tracking** \u00b7 after T1\n\nAdd and tick habits.\n\n- Files: `src/habits.js`\n- Done when: ticking updates streak\n- Verified by: `ls src/habits.js`\n\n## MVP coverage\n\n| MVP feature (approved brief) | Tasks |\n|---|---|\n| track habits | T2 |\n| daily reminder | T2 |\n| streaks | T2 |\n\n## Testing strategy\n\n- unit tests with vitest\n\n## Commands\n\n- Install: none\n- Test: `ls package.json`\n- Build: none\n- Dev server: `python3 -m http.server {port} --bind 127.0.0.1` (listens on `$PORT`)\n\n## Risks and decisions\n\n- localStorage can be cleared\n",
